     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Eih,<div>Would you mind posting this to shiny-discuss?  I suspect this is a shiny issue and not a <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362620531000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2B89N4DAeHuBxoGWwQvR_v\">shinyapps.io</a> issue, is that true?</div><div><br></div><div>-Tareef</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Nov 11, 2015 at 11:23 AM, Eih Shin Choo <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eihs...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, Im suspected that its not because of the programming language.<div><br><div>I&#39;m wondering why the Wald test cannot be printed to Shiny even it can be performed in R workplace.<div><br></div><div>example of codes:</div><div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"> regTermTest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Region</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Weight</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;LRT&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">waldtest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">test</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Chisq&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>Im suspected that its not because of the programming language.</div>My R version is 3.2.1. Is it needed to be updated so it can be recovered?</div><div><br><div><div>Here is the example of Shiny program that I have made (attachment) which is about uploading the SAFETY file and run the Wald Test.</div></div></div><div><br></div><div>In this program, the summary of the model be printed to shiny .Then, Wald test is failed to perform but it works in R workplace:</div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-21DP04Fe1P8/VkNo4UDmqzI/AAAAAAAAAAk/5HuDfZJvhEU/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-21DP04Fe1P8/VkNo4UDmqzI/AAAAAAAAAAk/5HuDfZJvhEU/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362620531000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EFw_RtpbHzyHeXJIEEObv\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-21DP04Fe1P8/VkNo4UDmqzI/AAAAAAAAAAk/5HuDfZJvhEU/s320/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"125\"></a><span style=\"text-align:center\">but in shiny: </span><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lC5RBECriZM/VkNp7KG-YEI/AAAAAAAAAA0/R3m6VH44u6A/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lC5RBECriZM/VkNp7KG-YEI/AAAAAAAAAA0/R3m6VH44u6A/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362620531000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2unH2DHM40DwXsVBANjLbM\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lC5RBECriZM/VkNp7KG-YEI/AAAAAAAAAA0/R3m6VH44u6A/s1600/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,255)\">It only works if it runs once in R workplace then runs the shiny Apps.</span></div><div>May I know why and how i solve it ?</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></font></span></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ShinyApps Users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shinyapps-use...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shinyap...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shinyapps-users/e1310ade-8734-41e7-955f-2bdf3636aa3f%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shinyapps-users/e1310ade-8734-41e7-955f-2bdf3636aa3f%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362620531000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XU9MLpt1il9z4dkE__yY4\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shinyapps-users/e1310ade-8734-41e7-955f-2bdf3636aa3f%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362620531000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VGW7Iujjar1LSTWt_o4cY\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout<